    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "小组作业总有人划水，可能也包括你。"
  },
  {
   "name": "02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "只要以为身后有几个人帮你，你就会少出百分之十五的力。"
  },
  {
   "name": "03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "一九七四年，心理学家让人拉绳子测力气。"
  },
  {
   "name": "04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "两个人一起拉，每人只出百分之九十一；"
  },
  {
   "name": "05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "三个人，百分之八十二；六个人，只剩百分之七十八。"
  },
  {
   "name": "06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "你可能会说：人一多，节奏对不齐嘛。"
  },
  {
   "name": "07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "于是他们蒙上你的眼睛，告诉你身后还有人一起拉。"
  },
  {
   "name": "08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "其实绳子上，只有你一个人在用力。"
  },
  {
   "name": "09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "以为有一个帮手，你出百分之九十；以为有两到六个，只剩百分之八十五。"
  },
  {
   "name": "10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "没人跟你抢节奏，少的这百分之十五，是你自己松的劲。"
  },
  {
   "name": "11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "因为人一多，就没人看得见你出了多少力。"
  },
  {
   "name": "12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "七十八项研究放在一起看，结论都一样："
  },
  {
   "name": "13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "只要每个人那份能被单独看见，划水几乎就消失了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "所以分工别写“大家一起做”，写清楚谁做哪一块。"
  },
  {
   "name": "15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "发到你的小组作业群，看看谁先回。"
  }
 ]
